# New Brink Constructors Inc. Website Launch: A Custom WordPress Build That Showcases Power and Precision

We’re proud to announce the launch of the new **Brink Constructors Inc.** website — a fully custom WordPress project designed and developed by our team here at **Brink Design**. This build combines high performance, visual impact, and user-friendly functionality to showcase Brink Constructors’ incredible work across the region.

## A Custom WordPress Experience with the Astra Framework

We built the new site using **WordPress** and the **Astra theme** — a proven foundation for speed and flexibility. To take things further, our team developed a **custom child theme**, allowing us to tailor every element to Brink Constructors’ brand identity and functional needs.

- Optimized performance with lean code and responsive design
- Extended customization via a purpose-built child theme
- Easy content management for the Brink team

The result is a fast, modern, and intuitive website that highlights the scale and expertise of Brink Constructors’ operations.

## Interactive Project Map: Built from Scratch

One of the standout features of this site is the **custom project map plugin** we developed specifically for Brink Constructors. This interactive tool visually displays where their crews are working — from powerline builds to substation upgrades — across the United States.

Visitors can explore:

- Active and completed project locations
- Project details and service types
- A live, map-based overview of Brink Constructors’ reach

This plugin was built for performance and flexibility, ensuring it can grow alongside Brink’s expanding footprint.

## Capturing the Action: Drone Videography

To bring Brink Constructors’ story to life, we coordinated **professional drone videography** to capture their **offices, fleet, and crews in action**. These cinematic shots now feature throughout the site, giving visitors a true sense of Brink’s scale, capability, and commitment to excellence.

> **Pro Tip:** Incorporating authentic, high-quality video footage helps establish trust and showcase the real people behind the work.

## About Brink Constructors Inc.

Founded in 1946 and headquartered in **Rapid City, South Dakota**, **Brink Constructors Inc.** is a leading electrical contractor specializing in **transmission, distribution, and substation construction**. With decades of experience and a safety-first culture, Brink serves utilities and energy providers across the nation.

Their expertise includes:

- Power line construction and maintenance
- Substation design and build services
- Renewable energy infrastructure
- Electrical contracting for utilities and heavy industry

This new website reflects the same precision, reliability, and professionalism that define Brink Constructors’ field work.

